From e7afcde690c0a12ac6f1dff2bfddba67d4c3783b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Elara <elara@portal.local>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:34:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] brand: the portal mark as the app icon everywhere

One drawing (dark void, two arcs turning in opposite directions, a lit core) is
written by tool/portal_icons.py into every place the build reads: Android legacy
mipmaps, the adaptive foreground and monochrome layers, the television mipmaps,
the macOS appiconset and the Windows .ico. The launcher icon and the in-app
connect control now show the same object.
